        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) The Local shall normally attempt to settle grievances with the levels of Local Management below that of the Operations Director, normally starting with the immediate Supervisor of the Employee or Employees involved. If not settled in those levels, the grievance may be taken up with the Operations Director. Grievances not settled by the Operations Director may be transferred to the National and, if so transferred, the Operations Director shall be notified.",
            "block_bbox": [
                374,
                200,
                911,
                324
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    374.0,
                    200.0
                ],
                [
                    911.0,
                    200.0
                ],
                [
                    911.0,
                    324.0
                ],
                [
                    374.0,
                    324.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Except where a shorter period is specifically set forth elsewhere in this Agreement, any grievance under the provisions of this Article must be presented to the Company within ninety (90) days following the occurrence of the action which gave rise to the grievance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                329,
                909,
                401
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    406.0,
                    329.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    329.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    401.0
                ],
                [
                    406.0,
                    401.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) When a grievance has been presented to Local Management by the Local, Local Management shall not initiate a further discussion of the grievance with the Employee involved unless the Job Steward or other representative of the Local is present.",
            "block_bbox": [
                375,
                406,
                908,
                478
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
